      "committer": {
        "name": "tbrasselle",
        "email": "tbrasselle@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-17T14:33:51Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): show the post script path in the Post dialog\n\nThe Post dialog's scope line now shows the full path of a shipped post\nscript beside its name (Fanuc (built-in) (C:\\...\\assets\\posts\\fanuc.cps)),\nso a user can see which script will run. It reuses the existing\nposting::builtin_post_path through a new posting::post_path helper; a user\nfile already names itself through post_ref_label, so only registry entries\nget the path suffix.\n\nNo posted output or program header changes, so goldens are unaffected.\nPinned by egui_app::post_dialog_tests::post_dialog_shows_the_shipped_post_path.\n\nFixes #2292",
