        "date": "2026-11-18T00:33:06Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): keep Post dialog header narrow, path on hover\n\nThe full post script path in the scope label widened the header row,\npushing the Operations tab off-screen on long checkout paths. Show only\nthe post name in the header (e.g. 'Fanuc (built-in)') and reveal the\nfull path on hover via a tooltip. This keeps the header width stable\nregardless of install path length.\n\nAlso update the pinning test to not depend on checkout path length, and\ndrop a stray blank line at the end of tests.rs.\n\nFixes #2292",
